 "voice": "long-ramayana-hisaab/ch3/voice.wav",
 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.137,
   "text": "Chapter do. Paisa kahan se aa raha hai.",
   "end": 2.352
  },
  {
   "start": 2.729,
   "text": "India ke 821 crore mein se 627 crore sirf Hindi version se aaye. Yaani 76 pratishat. Baaki chaar South bhashaon ne milke 194 crore, jisme sabse aage Kannada hai, 67 crore. Yash ka asar.",
   "end": 15.136
  },
  {
   "start": 15.441,
   "text": "Ab ek comparison jo kisi ne nahi dikhaya. Pushpa two Telugu film thi, phir bhi uske 1,234 crore India net mein se 812 crore Hindi dub se aaye the, lagbhag 66 pratishat. Ramayana Hindi film hai, aur uska Hindi hissa 76 pratishat hai.",
   "end": 29.561
  },
  {
   "start": 30.057,
   "text": "Matlab Ramayana ka engine Hindi belt hai. Aur aage badhne ki jagah do hi hain: South, aur videsh.",
   "end": 34.542
  },
  {
   "start": 35.0,
   "text": "Videsh se 502 crore, kul kamai ka 34 pratishat. Aur doosre weekend pe film chhe naye deshon mein khuli, jinme Indonesia aur Mexico bhi hain.",
   "end": 44.958
  },
  {
   "start": 44.958,
   "text": "Ab yahan se asli maza shuru hota hai. Kyunki agle chapter ka hisaab bataayega ki final number kya hoga, aur chapter chaar mein Dangal ke record ka ek twist hai jo trade wale nahi bataate.",
   "end": 55.494
  }
 ],
